WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.765
Launch with: fun_proteomics setup --project /path/to/my-study. One folder holds settings and results.

00:00:06.765 --> 00:00:16.198
Choose DIA-PASEF and scan your raw-data folder. This demo contains synthetic acquisition metadata only.

00:00:16.198 --> 00:00:23.588
Drag acquisition cards into Control or Treatment. Each card also has a condition dropdown.

00:00:23.588 --> 00:00:30.208
Move a card back to Unassigned to exclude it. Here we put it back into Control before saving.

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:38.024
Confirm independent biological replicates. Choose the matching target-only FASTA with gene annotations.

00:00:38.024 --> 00:00:45.607
Check inputs before running. Two conditions give one comparison at protein and available gene levels.

00:00:45.607 --> 00:00:52.610
The saved configuration and CSV/TSV assignment audit preserve these groups. With real spectra and installed tools, Run / continue starts the Nextflow workflow.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:58.616
This recording stops after setup. No spectrum search or biological result is claimed for synthetic acquisitions.

